;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ろうそく.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Yes, the story I'm about to tell is 'Motokizakura-sama.' [TN: Motokizakura: 'Motoki cherry tree'; -sama is an honorific.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's an urban legend of Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it differs from person to person, so it's an unusual one, with as many versions as there are people.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Motokizakura-sama. This is a kind of yokai that dwells only in Motoki-cho. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But the stories of Motokizakura-sama differ a great deal from person to person. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Do you know why that is?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
I asked the Motoki-cho group, but they all shook their heads.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Good, good. This might work.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\蝉。夕空。.ogg" "BGM2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM2" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜越しの曇天.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
There are said to be as many Motokizakura-sama as there are cherry trees in Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, there isn't just one Motokizakura-sama. There are countless of them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\モトキザクラ様.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Normally they can't be seen, but according to people who happened to witness one, she's a beautiful woman in a kimono with a cherry-blossom pattern.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And they all look the same.<PG>
Most of them are said to be something like guardian deities, always watching over the people of Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why Motoki-cho is said to have few crimes and accidents.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But in exchange, the rare incidents and accidents that do happen are said to be horrific.<PG>
Because there are Motokizakura-sama who are like evil spirits.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But since they all look the same, no one can tell them apart, and some people who carelessly approach one, far from receiving blessings, are said to meet a horrible fate.<PG>
That was a long introduction, but this time it's the story of an especially malicious Motokizakura-sama.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
This is the story of a girl who was in middle school about 10 years ago.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM2" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\モトキザクラドライブ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
For now, let's call that girl Girl A.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Girl A's family was one that worshipped Motokizakura-sama.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since most of them are guardian deities, there are apparently families that worship them like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the other hand, the worship is also meant to protect them from malicious Motokizakura-sama.<PG>
During Golden Week of Girl A's second year of middle school, the family went on a trip by car.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The plan was apparently to leave at night and reach their destination in the morning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were four of them: Girl A, her parents, and her little sister.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\モトキザクラドライブ2.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Night, 23:00. They were driving across the summit of Mount Motoki.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Summit or not, it was flat enough for cars to drive on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Girl A and her sister were asleep in the car, and their parents were taking turns driving.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was when it happened.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\モトキザクラ様遠い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "180" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A figure up the road.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Who could it be, this deep in the mountains?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When they drew closer―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\モトキザクラドライブ3.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\モトキザクラ様.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
A woman in a cherry-blossom-patterned kimono.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's Motokizakura-sama!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At their father's voice, Girl A and her sister woke up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車エンジン切る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\元木山看板.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
There was a sign there that read "Mount Motoki Summit."<PG>
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
They stopped the car beside the sign,
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Is something the matter? Would you like us to give you a ride?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When their father said that, the woman gave a small nod.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Girls, it's Motokizakura-sama! Scoot over!
{PAUSE ""}
　Here, please, please, come in!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Their father pressed Motokizakura-sama on the back, urging her into the car.<PG>
Since they worshipped Motokizakura-sama, Girl A and the others immediately made room and welcomed Motokizakura-sama in.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\モトキザクラドライブ2.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
With Motokizakura-sama aboard, the car set off.<PG>
Motokizakura-sama was riding with them. There were sure to be blessings!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Girl A and her sister were wide awake, and excited, even though it was the middle of the night.<PG>
―After they had driven for about 5 minutes...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Would you let me off here?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Motokizakura-sama said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They were still deep in the mountains.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She must have wanted to go somewhere out of human sight.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車エンジン切る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\モトキザクラ様バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
They stopped the car and let Motokizakura-sama out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\モトキザクラ様.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\モトキザクラ斜面.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Motokizakura-sama bowed once, then headed toward the slope beside the road.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
The slope was rough, rocky ground that looked hard to walk on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But Motokizakura-sama climbed it without the slightest trouble.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\モトキザクラ石段登り1.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Looking closely, they saw a narrow flight of stone steps on the slope.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\モトキザクラ様遠い.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "750" "100" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
Motokizakura-sama went up those stairs and vanished into the darkness.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"Dad, let's go after her!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When Girl A suggested it, everyone agreed at once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Motokizakura-sama's dwelling had to be up ahead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It would be rude, they felt, not to at least say a prayer there.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルト歩くずれ用.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
With no streetlights and no moonlight, it was pitch-dark all around.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The four of them climbed the stone steps, watching their footing.<PG>
―But however far they went, they couldn't see the end of the stairs. The dark made it worse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Dad, let's go back already..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"We've had the good fortune to meet Motokizakura-sama. We can't go home without doing anything!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One by one, complaints began to come from Girl A and her sister.<PG>
Just then.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\すきま風の声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "1000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\モトキザクラほこら1.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Suddenly the view opened up, and they reached the top.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Waiting at the top was a small <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="ほこら">shrine</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This had to be that Motokizakura-sama's dwelling.<PG>
"See, girls, aren't you glad we came? We made it all the way to Motokizakura-sama's home!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Way to go, Dad!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The tiredness from climbing the stone steps vanished all at once.<PG>
"Well then, let's pray properly. 
{PAUSE ""}
Motokizakura-sama, thank you for always protecting us. Taresaro Koniraku Sahan Iuyu Kinke."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\お参り.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
At their mother's word, the four of them <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ひらて">clapped their hands</STYLE> at the shrine and prayed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now their Golden Week family trip was sure to be a happy one.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They would come back here and pay their respects again on the way home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was while they were talking like that and starting back toward the stone steps.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\モトキザクラ看板1.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
Girl A noticed a signboard beside the <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="ほこら">shrine</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was very old and seemed to have been put up long ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Girl A and the others shone their phone lights on it and read the writing.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\モトキザクラ看板2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "300" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">This Motokizakura-sama</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Never touch</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Never speak to</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Never pray to</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\bgm_semarikuru.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Dad... you spoke to her earlier, and you pushed her on the back when we let her in the car, didn't you...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"And... we prayed..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it really have been a malicious Motokizakura-sama?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The blood drained from all four of their faces, and the four of them ran hurriedly down the stone steps.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュずれ用.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\モトキザクラ石段2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―But what was this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No matter how long they went on, they couldn't reach the road. The stone steps just kept going.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This was wrong! They should definitely have reached the road by now!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When they happened to look back...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "500" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\モトキザクラほこら1.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Apparently the summit, which should have been far behind them, was only a few steps above, and the shrine was in view.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Stairs they went down and down, yet could never get down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be that it was already too late?<PG>
No, they were imagining it! There were several paths, and they must have gone down the wrong steps.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They had no choice but to tell themselves things that made no sense by reason or by logic.<PG>
Thinking that if going down didn't work they should go up, they returned to the shrine to look for another set of stairs.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\モトキザクラ看板3.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The signboard beside the <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="ほこら">shrine</STYLE> caught their eye, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
it was clearly different from the one they had seen before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When they read the signboard...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\モトキザクラ看板4.gal" "WAIT" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">The stairs you descended, never climb</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">The stairs you climbed, never descend</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was only two lines, but it was enough to strike the four of them with even greater terror.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then,<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\モトキザクラ石段2.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\モトキザクラ様.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
From below on the stone steps, the woman from before, in the cherry-blossom-patterned kimono.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\モトキザクラ様バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
As the woman was about to pass by Girl A and the others...
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
her kimono brushed Girl A's hand.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
